の入口になる。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、史跡説明板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。鹿島藩ゆかりの領主碑や旧領境を示すしるべにも期待できる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":[],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["千綿駅（長崎県景観資産）","俵坂峠（長崎街道）","日本二十六聖人乗船場跡","キリシタン墓地","ひさご塚古墳","龍頭泉","玉簾の滝","千綿人形浄瑠璃"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E5%BD%BC%E6%9D%B5%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"東彼杵町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110801130","wikidata_qid":"Q942035","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E5%BD%BC%E6%9D%B5%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}